  {"name": "Deli / Specialty Cheese customer frontage — the 22 pt (2.4 m) north-south corridor between the deli island's east face and the Kitchen shelf run, open at both ends (north past the Cooking Connection kiosk, south into the Sushiya/Bakery floor). The island itself (x 944-994, y 292-392) is a closed drawn polygon the extractor already blocks, so the staff side needs no exclusion; the DELI anchor (999.9,377) prints on this floor just off the island's south-east corner, which is why its window read only 47% walkable.",
