  {"name": "West end of the Baby cross-corridor (customer) — the 16 pt aisle between the Baby block's bottom shelf row (ends y=418) and the aisle-27 hair-care row (starts y=434); the Toddler/Infant Feeding, Baby Food, Baby Water and Baby Formula shelf labels print in it. The derived auto:PHARMACY disk (pt (322.7,534.4), r=130) reaches up to y=404 and bridged this corridor's west 110 pt shut, culling it as a 449-cell dead crevice at (337,423) even though the same corridor stays open east of x=400.",
